{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Magic Construct&quot;</strong> is an action-survival game where you can <strong>freely edit skills</strong>. Through continuous upgrades and fateful choices, you\u2019ll carve a unique path for your character\u2019s growth. Use a <strong>simple connection mechanic</strong> to combine skill modules and create your own exclusive skills, surviving and growing stronger in a challenging world.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Every adventure is a fresh experience, and every choice will shape your destiny. Are you ready to take on the ultimate challenge of magic and survival?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Calm and Composed Combat Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Attacks with Status Effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Variety of Bizarre Creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309810/extras/\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1740976777\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Skills\u00a0System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By connecting new nodes, projectiles gain the attributes of those modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more nodes you connect, the stronger your projectiles become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some nodes allow you to adjust their attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309810/extras/\u8fde\u63a5.gif?t=1740976777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Difficulty\u00a0System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map offers a variety of tags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tag corresponds to a specific mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By selecting different tags, you can create a unique gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309810/extras/\u96be\u5ea6.png?t=1740976777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Achievements\u00a0System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlocking achievements rewards you with new items, characters, attributes, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309810?t=1740976777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309810?t=1740976777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309810/8a2a94162e06e36c0c8742910c7d7c8ba2f01a61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740976777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309810/8a2a94162e06e36c0c8742910c7d7c8ba2f01a61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740976777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Magic Construct&quot;</strong> is an action-survival game where you can <strong>freely edit skills</strong>. Through continuous upgrades and fateful choices, you\u2019ll carve a unique path for your character\u2019s growth. Use a <strong>simple connection mechanic</strong> to combine skill modules and create your own exclusive skills, surviving and growing stronger in a challenging world.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Every adventure is a fresh experience, and every choice will shape your destiny. Are you ready to take on the ultimate challenge of magic and survival?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Calm and Composed Combat Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Attacks with Status Effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Variety of Bizarre Creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"